
# Lava Lamp Screensaver — References (W3Schools + p5.js)

---

## CSS References (from W3Schools)
- **Animations & Keyframes** — https://www.w3schools.com/css/css3_animations.asp  
  Defines how elements smoothly change properties over time.

- **Transforms** — https://www.w3schools.com/cssref/func_translate.php  

- **Filters (hue-rotate)** — https://www.w3schools.com/cssref/css3_pr_filter.php  
  Gradually shifts blob color tones.

- **Gradients** — https://www.w3schools.com/css/css3_gradients_radial.asp  
  Used for smooth blob edges and color blending.

- **Box Shadow** — https://www.w3schools.com/cssref/css3_pr_box-shadow.php  
  Creates the blob’s glow effect.

- **Flexbox Layout** — https://www.w3schools.com/css/css3_flexbox.asp  
  Centers the clock and AM/PM vertically and horizontally.

- **Typography (Font Family)** — https://www.w3schools.com/cssref/pr_font_font-family.php  
  Applies the Google Font *Didact Gothic* to the text.

- **Media Queries** — https://www.w3schools.com/css/css3_mediaqueries_ex.asp  
  Used to handle screen resizing and accessibility options (like reduced motion).

